# Docs & site sync

After any change to product behavior, UX, permissions, privacy, map/events/rooms/timeline, or release notes — **before finishing** — update every affected surface:

1. **Repo markdown**: `README.md`, `PRIVACY.md`, `TERMS.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and any other `*.md` that describes the changed behavior.
2. **Public site** (if available locally): `../aib-site` — especially `app/sitac/` (`page.tsx`, `guide`, `privacy`, `terms`), `lib/sitac/copy.ts`, `components/sitac/`, and related CSS/assets. If that path is missing, skip and say so briefly.

Keep IT/EN copy aligned where both exist. Preserve unofficial volunteer framing (no institutional affiliation). Do not leave docs or the site describing old behavior.
